Body:
IMO, opencode should support this feature in one way or another. The current problem is that even with the configuration below, which denies the skill usage, the skill description is still loaded to the context window. So you can't invoke the skill in any way, but it's still present in the context, which makes no sense. 
```json
{
  "permission": {
    "skill": {
      "internal-*": "deny",
    }
  }
}
```
